   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## FLUX.3 klein turbo PDD\n\n- **steps**: 8 (best) or 4 (faster). 2 is a quick composition preview with a fixed seed: low detail.\n- The prompt upsampler is off by default; turn on `enable upsampler` for short prompts (as in the comparison images).\n- Keep cfg 1, `euler` and the loader's SIGMAS (CFG is distilled into the LoRA).\n- Models: [flux-3-image-klein-comfy](https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/flux-3-image-klein-comfy) (base bf16, text encoder, upsampler, VAE) and the LoRA from [Flux-3-Klein-turbo-pdd-4_8-steps](https://huggingface.co/NoiseToNova/Flux-3-Klein-turbo-pdd-4_8-steps)."
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "Guide: [Subgraph](https://docs.comfy.org/interface/features/subgraph)\n\n## How to use\n\n1. Type your prompt in **Prompt**.\n2. Optional: draw **Bounding boxes** and give each one a description. Leave it empty for a normal prompt.\n   **\u26a0\ufe0f Requires Nodes 2.0 (ComfyUI icon \u2192 Nodes 2.0).**\n3. **Prompt Upsampler** expands the prompt; with boxes it keeps them and expands their descriptions. The result is shown in **Upsampled prompt**. Turn it off with *enable upsampler*.\n4. **Diffusion** renders the image: base model, 50 steps, cfg 4 (the empty negative prompt is the reference default). Pick the models, seed and *alpha* (timestep shift; default 16, the model's reference is 6.93) there.\n\n## Prompt upsampler\n\nThe upsampler's system prompts are published at [black-forest-labs/flux-3-image-klein-pup](https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/flux-3-image-klein-pup).\n\n## Model Links\n\n- [Hugging Face:black-forest-labs/flux-3-image-klein-comfy](https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/flux-3-image-klein-comfy)\n\n**text_encoders**\n\n- [qwen3.5_9b_flux3_prompt_upsampler_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/flux-3-image-klein-comfy/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3.5_9b_flux3_prompt_upsampler_bf16.safetensors)\n- [qwen3vl_4b_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/flux-3-image-klein-comfy/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_4b_bf16.safetensors)\n\n**diffusion_models**\n\n- [flux3-image-klein-base-bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/flux-3-image-klein-comfy/resolve/main/diffusion_models/flux3-image-klein-base-bf16.safetensors)\n\n**vae**\n\n- [flux2-vae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/flux-3-image-klein-comfy/resolve/main/vae/flux2-vae.safetensors)\n\n\n## Model Storage Location\n\n```\n\ud83d\udcc2 ComfyUI/\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 \ud83d\udcc2 models/\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 \ud83d\udcc2 text_encoders/\n\u2502   \u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 qwen3.5_9b_flux3_prompt_upsampler_bf16.safetensors\n\u2502   \u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 qwen3vl_4b_bf16.safetensors\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 \ud83d\udcc2 diffusion_models/\n\u2502   \u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 flux3-image-klein-base-bf16.safetensors\n\u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 \ud83d\udcc2 vae/\n\u2502       \u2514\u2500\u2500 flux2-vae.safetensors\n```\n\n## Report Issue\n\nNote: Please update ComfyUI first ([guide](https://docs.comfy.org/installation/update_comfyui)) and prepare required models. Desktop/Cloud updates follow stable releases, so some nightly-supported models may not be available yet.\n\n- Cannot run / runtime errors: [ComfyUI/issues](https://github.com/comfyanonymous/ComfyUI/issues)\n- UI / frontend issues: [ComfyUI_frontend/issues](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI_frontend/issues)\n- Workflow issues: [workflow_templates/issues](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/issues)\n"
   },
   "color": "#222",
   "bgcolor": "#000"
  },
